WEBVTT

00:02:59.329 --> 00:03:01.329
schedule another financial health day

00:03:01.329 --> 00:03:02.621
for a few weeks later.

00:03:02.621 --> 00:03:05.204
Chances are, you'll need to revisit
some of the things

00:03:05.204 --> 00:03:06.413
you started today.

00:03:06.413 --> 00:03:08.829
I know all of this may seem
tedious or boring,

00:03:08.871 --> 00:03:11.038
but it's better to make
these vital changes

00:03:11.079 --> 00:03:13.329
when you have the time
to think about them,

00:03:13.329 --> 00:03:15.746
and not under the stressful conditions

00:03:15.788 --> 00:03:18.579
when we usually make
these very important decisions.

00:03:18.621 --> 00:03:20.788
Not every day can be a spa day,

00:03:20.788 --> 00:03:22.204
but I think a financial day

00:03:22.246 --> 00:03:25.413
will leave you feeling
soothed and pampered.